044-1.215.044-2.04.044H11.8c-.825 0-1.497 0-2.041-.044-.554-.045-1.053-.141-1.518-.378a3.879 3.879 0 0 1-1.694-1.694c-.237-.465-.333-.964-.378-1.518-.044-.544-.044-1.215-.044-2.04V14.8z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M11.12 15.006a.89.89 0 0 1 .262-.625.89.89 0 0 1 .625-.262.83.83 0 0 1 .612.263l.386.414c.698.747 1.407 1.483 2.12 2.216V4a.875.875 0 0 1 1.75 0v13.006a151.522 151.522 0 0 0 2.507-2.625.83.83 0 0 1 .612-.262.89.89 0 0 1 .625.263.89.89 0 0 1 .262.625.83.83 0 0 1-.263.612l-.414.386a153.944 153.944 0 0 0-3.663 3.54.759.759 0 0 1-1.09 0 153.955 153.955 0 0 0-4.07-3.927.83.83 0 0 1-.262-.612z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="animate-in fade-in-0 min-w-0 duration-300 ease-out"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div dir="auto" class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">What I improved:</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Geometry:</span> Same laptop + phone + cursor idea, but now with consistent stroke weight, perfect rounded corners, and true symmetry</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Colors:</span> Bright web-blue #0A84FF for the laptop, charcoal #2F2F2F for phone/cursor/text — pops on any background and works in dark mode</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Typography:</span> Modern geometric sans, wider tracking, bolder — much more legible at small sizes (navbar, favicon)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Proportions:</span> Icons scaled up and centered over the text, no more stretched or warped shapes from the original photo</li>
</ul>
<p>It's a true transparent PNG, so you can drop it straight into your header, landing page, or app icon.</p>
<p>Want me to also make:</p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">A <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">horizontal version</span> for your navbar (icon left, CLICK right)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">A <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">icon-only</span> square version for favicon / app store</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">A <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">white version</span> for dark backgrounds?</li>
