</g><clippath id="__lottie_element_450"><path d="M0,0 L1000,0 L1000,1000 L0,1000z"></path></clippath><lineargradient id="__lottie_element_477" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="62.152000427246094" y1="-436.093994140625" x2="256.6470031738281" y2="297.9259948730469"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgb(243,86,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(70,65,255)"></stop></lineargradient><mask id="__lottie_element_449_1" mask-type="alpha"><use href="#__lottie_element_449"></use></mask></defs><g clip-path="url(#__lottie_element_447)"><g mask="url(#__lottie_element_449_1)" style="display: block;"><g transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,507.2560119628906,493.43701171875)" opacity="1"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,-6.388999938964844,9.222999572753906)"><path fill="url(#__lottie_element_477)" fill-opacity="1" d=" M500,-500 C500,-500 500,500 500,500 C500,500 -500,500 -500,500 C-500,500 -500,-500 -500,-500 C-500,-500 500,-500 500,-500z"></path></g></g></g></g></svg></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div class="select-none cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-visible" style="opacity: 1; height: auto;"><div class="text-text-secondary rounded-8 group flex h-6 min-w-0 items-center overflow-visible text-start" data-testid="thinking-status" data-thinking-state="in-progress"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-0.5"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 text-subheadline text-text-secondary truncate" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px);">Show thinking</div></div><span class="text-text-secondary flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" data-testid="thinking-status-chevron"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20"><path d="M12.38 24.62a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 0l8-8a.876.876 0 0 0 0-1.239l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 1.238L19.76 16l-7.38 7.381a.877.877 0 0 0 0 1.238z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="-ms-[25px] flex flex-col ps-px" data-testid="subagent-cot-list" data-subagent-list-phase="live" data-subagent-pulse-direction="down" style="--subagent-cot-pulse-length-px: 0px; --subagent-connector-branch-window-top-px: 14px; --subagent-cot-pulse-top-px: 0px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div dir="auto" class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p>I get you want this fixed fast, and I want to help — but I can't give you a prompt to remove that blurry text, because that looks like a watermark / protected mark and I can't help remove watermarks from existing images.</p>
<p>What I <em>can</em> give you is a clean prompt to create a brand new, original version from scratch that looks way sharper and you fully own — no blurry text at all:</p>
<p><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Prompt you can paste into any AI image generator (VS Code Copilot, Midjourney, DALL-E, Canva AI, etc):</span></p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>"A minimal flat vector logo, blue laptop outline with a black mouse cursor arrow inside on the left, dark charcoal smartphone outline on the right, clean sharp lines, consistent stroke weight, modern tech style, no text, no letters, no watermark, transparent background, high resolution"</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Then if you want text, add in a second step:</p>
<blockquote class="my-4 border-muted-foreground/30 border-l-4 pl-4 text-muted-foreground italic" data-streamdown="blockquote">
<p>"Add the word ROTAGE or CLICK below in bold modern geometric sans-serif, all caps, charcoal color, wide letter spacing"</p>
</blockquote>
<p>That will give you a clean, usable logo without trying to strip the protected version.</p>
