618b1b2f1\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L88\",null,{\"variant\":\"grid\",\"ideasTemplateListPromise\":\"$@89\",\"newStartersPromise\":\"$@8a\",\"tryMetaAiStartersPromise\":\"$@8b\",\"forYouStartersPromise\":\"$@8c\",\"smbProBundleStarters\":[]}]}]\n"])</script><script nonce="">self.__next_f.push([1,"8a:[{\"id\":\"1987641768554253\",\"text\":\"Explain sci-fi cars with real physics\",\"prompt\":\"Walk me through the DeLorean time machine, the Magic School Bus, a Star Wars X-Wing, Mario Kart, and the Flintstones' foot-car. Fire up sub-agents to explain what physics/engineering would actually be needed to make each one work.\",\"iconName\":\"LIST_BADGE_SEARCH\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_fast\"},{\"id\":\"1057641619954637\",\"text\":\"Explain mythical creature biology\",\"prompt\":\"Walk me through dragons, phoenixes, krakens, unicorns, and mermaids. Fire up sub-agents to explain how each creature's signature ability would actually work biologically (fire breathing, regeneration, deep-sea pressure survival, etc.). Organize response by creature and include an image or infographic of each.\",\"iconName\":\"BOOK\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_hard\"},{\"id\":\"1553254852933005\",\"text\":\"Turn notes into a study guide\",\"prompt\":\"Here's a picture of my handwritten notes. Transcribe them and create an interactive artifact organized by topic with quizzes to test my understanding.\",\"iconName\":\"BOOK_OPEN\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/m1/v/t0.83350-7/An_6yN4Bhw5QsgovrxflB8GpMEwp5L_oBn1VmOjoyeyW8giUEbu_z2Mzfn4ipoJ3g7HcbYKP6bcBwPa9PyXYNRPr8Qsn3CxYfK8FLiKlrtygSRvQaGvYywI0f9U.jpg?stp=s256x256\u0026_nc_gid=y-qGpYghwzD90z47Kl5zag\u0026_nc_oc=AdptALi7iSHTLPLIdGQr5pfRHlGFsLZ8Zm7OrBfxRLOn-KX_uvzVOnhtde-UDn9-fhw\u0026strext=1\u0026ccb=10-5\u0026oh=00_AQLbYWJ6flszkO4nW7K2L-IUhk_e1Jzj6ZczkV7Km5TvDw\u0026oe=6A97C090\u0026_nc_sid=087463\",\"attachmentType\":\"MEDIA_PICKER\",\"mode\":\"think_hard\"},{\"id\":\"1740428430323169\",\"text\":\"Create a 20 min daily workout\",\"prompt\":\"Set up a daily task for 6am. Each morning, give me a 20-minute at-home workout with no equipment, rotating the muscle groups so it varies and builds through the week. Tell me the day's focus and how hard it should feel. For each exercise include a clear image, a plain-language how-to with one form or safety cue, and the reps or work/rest interval. Add a short warm-up and cool-down, and give an easier and a harder option. Keep the total to about 20 minutes. Run it now in addition to creating the task.\",\"iconName\":\"FIGURE_BARBELL\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/m1/v/t0.83350-7/An9WHLHe8aXjuzmbITUJK5MP5eVlfiOWF0y77boZb8_hcdQtYsznB8E0QQ1rfg5W9viO5GvUZnApytegtwLQo2JMwnJPb1SEM3oZ7la71a_n4nFdZKP-ADFZVA.jpg?stp=s256x256\u0026_nc_gid=y-qGpYghwzD90z47Kl5zag\u0026_nc_oc=AdrCh3DRrGamKF-cQVPXvfgjOrekJ7xykeiPbin8LvEDWd6QTPI4t6XP4VCeUFuJBfg\u0026strext=1\u0026ccb=10-5\u0026oh=00_AQLPJHJUZSmEqamSH7uJdnjPLV3LMTYQQhtbiGXwrWmujQ\u0026oe=6A97C662\u0026_nc_sid=087463\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_fast\"},{\"id\":\"1544611136608330\",\"text\":\"Recap calendar and email\",\"prompt\":\"Read my email inbox and calendar and summarize my action items for the upcoming week in an engaging manner. Have grouped sections and have a clear bullet per action item. Focus on my email inbox specifically. Don't list out each of my calendar events, only highlight actions I should take. Take note of the current date/time, don't reference events in the past. Create this quickly! If I haven’t connected my email or calendar yet, help me do so first. Ask me after running if I want to make this into a daily scheduled task.\",\"iconName\":\"ENVELOPE\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/m1/v/t0.83350-7/An-PiCMABLzTj1lA1jr8I0475WhCpeV8IGrimG4cDcO1ffBEZEpwhmSOBGwqIXsYF7UFz9WBJcrfs7MuXKkH264Fe2JdZZ2GHXLuLTXUd1lirg8ownQBy76Mujg.jpg?stp=s256x256\u0026_nc_gid=y-qGpYghwzD90z47Kl5zag\u0026_nc_oc=AdpTae0uv4doQ94FaNEUFXRD63dcDNJi8xg-7EFP69S2JHtkU_P3-WC_3IznZBePcTA\u0026strext=1\u0026ccb=10-5\u0026oh=00_AQJeZDvHxJi7u0PDhCpAU2rPZ4OvR8Nfz1f_BSDkCqK_PA\u0026oe=6A97DE73\u0026_nc_sid=087463\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_hard\"},{\"id\":\"1595749168589438\",\"text\":\"Audit my paid subscriptions\",\"prompt\":\"Pull all of my active subscriptions and tell me what is actually useful vs not\",\"iconName\":\"LIST_BADGE_SEARCH\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_hard\"},{\"id\":\"2522364098269569\",\"text\":\"Compare clean energy types\",\"prompt\":\"Walk me through solar, wind, hydro, nuclear, and geothermal energy sources. Fire up subagents to explain how it actually converts its source into electricity. Generate a high-level infographic and some charts.\",\"iconName\":\"LIST_BADGE_SEARCH\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/m1/v/t0.83350-7/An8jlmgOkC_jQhqpTWKlMChWJJVS1yAoJy6jX__QH0txsRuJJUBjSu0XldGruwwmDeBl6KdOs-2x2w_nbgFGG0Mrvnf5mYW-dp2zg7F1FCg9WXJY5E4YEc7-Ud4.jpg?stp=s256x256\u0026_nc_gid=y-qGpYghwzD90z47Kl5zag\u0026_nc_oc=AdoYJC9ObFV9uYHxnrBE80-Co1LUk8BbP0Pq_WbbCzfxZhLwNqNis-horCNLfWarbgw\u0026strext=1\u0026ccb=10-5\u0026oh=00_AQJ0fldFj1xkRa913mT3GcrWUyuQyp_4BCSioYNZMY7z4A\u0026oe=6A97E326\u0026_nc_sid=087463\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_fast\"},{\"id\":\"37298981036384422\",\"text\":\"Make a trending seasonal recipe\",\"prompt\":\"Find me a trending recipe using seasonal and local ingredients. Put the recipe into an artifact that is engaging and interactive with offered substitutions and media.\",\"iconName\":\"WHISK_SPATULA\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/m1/v/t0.83350-7/An_xqpDU73zt9Ag7ZasT50tK9CPEv5H4bDJ75Jh-neDddZxVTP5wPHXysuAvCqQz2vflzFWIqjq3c8T48KZg-VWJumrdV-UumENV7FjyTX-ZICQRHp1KSN36tg.jpg?stp=s256x256\u0026_nc_gid=y-qGpYghwzD90z47Kl5zag\u0026_nc_oc=AdpKEdfSMIE445ZyGeI1L2_OOpJSsE3_SHR1j0eWZ1BLmTqxvJf2ZPC3B1rkNpIQAuY\u0026strext=1\u0026ccb=10-5\u0026oh=00_AQLDTXK_tnrEKonnX-FDNLYX0BUwwgdu2hoWfhQf2kqtYA\u0026oe=6A97EFC1\u0026_nc_sid=087463\",\"attachmentType\":\"NONE\",\"mode\":\"think_hard\"}]\n"])</script><link rel="preload" href="./login screen_files/1mzourbqe419g.js.download" as="script" nonce="" fetchpriority="low" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><link rel="preload" href="./login screen_files/34mi9whkdnggv.js.download" as="script" nonce="" fetchpriority="low" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><link rel="preload" href="./login screen_files/2jntgx33nn118.js.download" as="script" nonce="" fetchpriority="low" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><link rel="preload" href="./login screen_files/323mky4ee725g.js.download" as="script" nonce="" fetchpriority="low" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><script nonce="">$RC("B:12","S:12")</script><script nonce="">self.__next_f.push([1,"72:{\"data\":{\"pinnedConversations\":{\"edges\":[],\"pageInfo\":{\"endCursor\":null,\"hasNextPage\":false}},\"unpinnedConversations\":{\"edges\":[{\"node\":{\"id\":\"1a463565-033e-4051-b6a6-9f53923a1323\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-27T17:19:13.000Z\",\"conversationId\":\"1271187019411058\",\"title\":\"Comparing my answers\",\"displayTitle\":\"Comparing my answers\",\"pinned\":false,\"isUnread\":false,\"wearableSurface\":null,\"matchingSnippet\":null,\"matchingSnippets\":null,\"type\":\"CHAT\",\"__typename\":\"Conversation\"},\"cursor\":\"QVFIVHowRFIzcTdTMlh4YWtkXzlhSmszRUctT19nNnNPb1BZAXzc5d1ZADZAGhZARWNXZA05NVGZAuTllKNDdhTDhlSEN4R0JKQ1VhbmVHSEZAYSXR0WDlOM3JJYjFB\"},{\"node\":{\"id\":\"092da568-592a-41d7-b8bb-e4672dee13b6\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-26T14:12:32.000Z\",\"conversationId\":\"1269689566227470\",\"title\":\"My electronic signature\",\"displayTitle\":\"My electronic signature\",\"pinned\":false,\"isUnread\":false,\"wearableSurface\":null,\"matchingSnippet\":null,\"matchingSnippets\":null,\"type\":\"CHAT\",\"__typename\":\"Conversation\"},\"cursor\":\"QVFI