my character looks like a retro video game character, no realism or high-fidelity graphics. Style the animation like an old CRT monitor with scan lines and warped edges, ensure that the scan lines and warped edges are consistent in each frame. Add my name to the jersey, but don't include any other text on in the GIF.\",\"segments\":[{\"type\":\"static\",\"text\":\"Make a 6 FPS animated GIF of me as a basketball player in a retro basketball arcade game called Retro Jams, matching the style of arcade basketball games in the 90s and create an animated GIF of me dunking and breaking the backboard in an indoor basketball court similar to the 90s style arcade basketball games. Add a crowd cheering in the stands. When the backboard breaks, ensure that the white square on the backboard breaks also. Ensure that my character looks like a retro video game character, no realism or high-fidelity graphics. Style the animation like an old CRT monitor with scan lines and warped edges, ensure that the scan lines and warped edges are consistent in each frame. Add my name to the jersey, but don't include any other text on in the GIF.\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[]},{\"id\":\"1955588891810799\",\"agentOption\":null,\"chipTitle\":\"rockstar makeover\",\"clipTextRange\":{\"offset\":19,\"length\":17},\"displayedTitle\":\"Give this person a rockstar makeover\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"Give this person a Rockstar makeover\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\"thumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQP79xo1qQhO9zgb8vQXpK8vNds-gRhiy5l3fT6OD-q3PuG8meba41WQVABWceAkisjKuGU4Xp_mgBU25GFsNDVA.png?_nc_cat=108\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=PDfoEQ26MKEQ7kNvwFR4sLC\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=_U7Xtb9zee--ohvQab6aeA\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQJqQgxS09OoOGyt35CDcg1_-l-4spwNDizFPkVQxf0Gog\u0026oe=6ABD7008\",\"squareThumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.