ance, but aged and a little dusty like it's been sitting on the shelf for a while. Face and hair are all solid porcelain with a high-gloss lacquered finish, stylised not realistic. Give the hair some soft sculpted volume, but no individual strands or flyaways at all. Put some books and a plant peeking into the scene. Shelf should be relatively clean and free from dirt and dust.\",\"segments\":[{\"type\":\"static\",\"text\":\"Make a tiny, shiny porcelain mid-section tabletop sculpture from a photo of this person that is placed directly on a wooden bookshelf. Porcelain sculpture is about 2 inches tall, camera at a 3/4 angle, slight vignetting. It's very glossy, colour-matched to their appearance, but aged and a little dusty like it's been sitting on the shelf for a while. Face and hair are all solid porcelain with a high-gloss lacquered finish, stylised not realistic. Give the hair some soft sculpted volume, but no individual strands or flyaways at all. Put some books and a plant peeking into the scene. Shelf should be relatively clean and free from dirt and dust.\"}],\"userInputSteps\":[{\"stepType\":\"IMAGE_PICKER\",\"suggestedMediaCount\":1,\"textSuggestions\":[],\"title\":\"Choose an image\"}]},{\"id\":\"1934431373911260\",\"agentOption\":\"MODE_THINKING\",\"chipTitle\":\"trendy hairstyles\",\"clipTextRange\":{\"offset\":33,\"length\":17},\"displayedTitle\":\"Imagine this person with various trendy hairstyles\",\"capitalizedTitle\":\"Imagine this person with various Trendy hairstyles\",\"iconUri\":\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yQ/r/S7BiHLGF0qz.webp\",\"thumbnailUri\":\"https://scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t6/f2/m421/AQPUmWPYI2foqzKqNVKcNpjmVJ5uJvJqRcFsXohjkZ3AyFKsRPCLwExIuJFy37MMR4nlc28LRnC_Krm_e3POcTeQ.jpg?_nc_cat=101\u0026_nc_sid=5b3566\u0026_nc_ht=scontent-arn2-1.xx.fbcdn.net\u0026_nc_ohc=XVrvzwoKmxUQ7kNvwG17uYL\u0026stp=s325x325_tt6\u0026ccb=17-1\u0026_nc_gid=_U7Xtb9zee--ohvQab6aeA\u0026_nc_zt=14\u0026_nc_ss=7b289\u0026oh=00_AQJ_yExR6hnNelwl2e9VR